flowchart TD
    Exp[mysqld_exporter<br/>node_exporter] --> Prom[Prometheus<br/>15s scrape]:::infra
    Prom --> MC[MetricsCollector<br/>拉取 PromQL + 对齐时间序列]:::step
    MC --> AD[AnomalyDetector<br/>多算法并行检测]:::step
    AD --> T1[阈值检测]:::sub
    AD --> T2[MK 趋势检测]:::sub
    AD --> T3[CUSUM 变点检测]:::sub
    AD --> T4[MAD 离群检测]:::sub
    T1 --> NF[NoiseFilter<br/>降噪策略]:::step
    T2 --> NF
    T3 --> NF
    T4 --> NF
    NF --> AE[异常事件]:::output
    AE --> RC[第11讲<br/>根因因果图]:::step

    style Exp fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style Prom fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style AE fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    classDef infra fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#7b1fa2
    classDef step fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0
    classDef sub fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#01579b
    classDef output fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ef6c00
